11
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Undo and redo remain visible, revisioned operations.

12
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Save, reopen and continue from the same editable world.

13
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Export the published pump model as validated OpenUSD USDA and STEP.

14
